# Runtime dependencies — the product. This is the file humans edit; the pinned,
# hashed `requirements.txt` beside it is generated from it and is what actually
# gets installed (see README.md -> Dependency locking for the regeneration command).
#
# The floors below say "the oldest release known to work"; the lock says "the
# exact release this was developed and tested against". Both matter: the floor
# documents intent, the lock is what makes two machines identical.

