# NOT a runtime dependency, deliberately:
#
# - pytest and the rest of the test/lint tooling live in requirements-dev.in.
#   This file is the manifest installed on the Raspberry Pi; a test runner has
#   no business shipping with the product.
#
# - playwright: OPTIONAL, for automatic DataDome cookie harvesting
#   (services/cookie_harvester.py) and the availability check's browser
#   transport. It pulls a ~300 MB browser and the app runs fine without it —
#   the feature just hides its button (invariant 18). To enable:
#       pip install playwright && playwright install chromium
#
# - camoufox: OPTIONAL, the stealth-Firefox engine preferred over Chromium when
#   present (`browser_engine="auto"`). Same reasoning, its own browser download:
#       pip install camoufox
